# --- Large corpus holdings (kept on disk, not in version control) ---
# Vāksañcayaḥ ASR corpus: 46,010 MP3s (2.1 GB), CC BY-NC 4.0 — local-only copy (untracked 2026-09-23)
corpus/vaksancayah/
# Vedavani: embedded git-lfs clone (HF). The parent repo cannot track its
# contents (incl. MANIFEST.csv / split CSVs referenced by PROVENANCE.md) —
# kept local-only; re-clone from huggingface.co/datasets/sanganaka/Vedavani-Dataset
corpus/vedavani/
# Mahabharata parva audio (2.5 GB) — per-repo READMEs stay tracked
corpus/mahabharata_audio/**/mp3/

# --- HuggingFace dataset clones ---
ASR-Sanskrit/
Vedavani-Dataset/
Vedavani-main/

# --- Raw data & corpora (local-only) ---
# Former local holding dir for a byte-identical copy of corpus/vedavani/
# audio (20,702 WAVs, 4.3 GB, re-copied 2026-10-01); deleted 2026-10-22
# after full sha256 re-verification (0 mismatches) — Review.md Phase 6
# entry 2026-10-22. Rule kept as a guard in case the copy reappears.
Audio_files/
# Vāksañcayaḥ ASR corpus root (alternate location)
Vāksañcayaḥ- Sanskrit_ASR_Corpus/
Vaksanca-master
Vaksanca-master.zip
# Parva audio (Mahabharata) — directories at root
parva*/
# Parquet data files (ASR-Sanskrit Whisper features)
**/*.parquet
